<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore oil product markets closed for holidays.</title>
<headline>Singapore oil product markets closed for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore oil products markets are closed from Friday through Monday for the Lunar New Year and Eid al-Fitri holidays.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the market was lacklustre as most companies only operated until midday.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
